k olun!  Onları durdurmalıyız!Dialogue: 5,0:17:11.00,0:17:13.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kapıyı kapatın!Dialogue: 5,0:17:26.69,0:17:28.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, nine!Dialogue: 5,0:17:28.25,0:17:29.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, ne oldu?Dialogue: 5,0:17:29.69,0:17:31.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Planda değişiklik oldu!Dialogue: 5,0:17:31.27,0:17:33.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çocuklar, sanırım planda değişiklik oldu.Dialogue: 5,0:17:33.73,0:17:38.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Samuray-adam, vagonda sıkıca bir yerlere tutunmanızı söylüyor.Dialogue: 5,0:17:38.07,0:17:40.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sıkıca bir şeye mi tutunalım?Dialogue: 5,0:17:40.24,0:17:43.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, aptal kılıç ustası!  Bir şey mi oldu?Dialogue: 5,0:17:43.25,0:17:46.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ana Kapı kapandı.Dialogue: 5,0:17:46.21,0:17:47.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne dedin?!Dialogue: 5,0:17:47.75,0:17:50.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durum kötü. Gerçekten ezileceğiz!Dialogue: 5,0:17:50.76,0:17:52.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapacağız? Ne yapacağız?Dialogue: 5,0:17:52.44,0:17:54.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Bir şekilde atlat, Kokoro-san ! – Ne yapacağız?!Dialogue: 5,0:17:56.05,0:17:59.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Endişeye gerek yok.  Bir yolu var.Dialogue: 5,0:18:04.25,0:18:06.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Parmaklığı kır, kurbağa!Dialogue: 5,0:18:06.44,0:18:08.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 5,0:18:10.06,0:18:11.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vırak!Dialogue: 5,0:18:14.03,0:18:17.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vırak!Dialogue: 5,0:18:20.95,0:18:23.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vırak, vırak, vırak!Dialogue: 5,0:18:33.50,0:18:34.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoksa...!Dialogue: 5,0:18:34.83,0:18:37.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Parmaklığı bu şekilde mi aşacağız?!Dialogue: 5,0:18:46.81,0:18:49.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İMKANSIZ!Dialogue: 5,0:18:49.35,0:18:51.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz treni...Dialogue: 5,0:18:51.61,0:18:53.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...uçuyor!Dialogue: 5,0:18:53.73,0:18:56.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öleceğiz!Dialogue: 5,0:18:56.74,0:18:59.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ölecek miyiz?!Dialogue: 5,0:18:59.24,0:19:00.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahhh!Dialogue: 5,0:19:00.54,0:19:03.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-san!  Hemen kucağıma gel!Dialogue: 5,0:19:03.32,0:19:06.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sence de şu anda yeterince sorunum yok mu, aptal?!Dialogue: 5,0:19:10.75,0:19:14.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!  Bir plan düşünmüş olmalısın, değil mi?!Dialogue: 5,0:19:16.96,0:19:18.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu işi...Dialogue: 5,0:19:19.47,0:19:21.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vaay...Dialogue: 5,0:19:26.62,0:19:28.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– ...şansa bırakın. – Vırak!Dialogue: 5,0:19:28.69,0:19:30.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şansa mı bırakalım?!Dialogue: 5,0:19:36.28,0:19:39.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oimo yenildi!Dialogue: 5,0:19:57.84,0:20:00.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Siz... Hasır Şapka'nın tayfasından mısınız?Dialogue: 5,0:20:00.93,0:20:03.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Evet! – Öyle mi?!Dialogue: 5,0:20:03.93,0:20:07.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunun hiçbir önemi yok.Dialogue: 5,0:20:07.17,0:20:09.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha da ileri gitmek için acele etmeliyiz.Dialogue: 5,0:20:09.14,0:20:14.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam, beyler! Şimdi tüm yapmamız gereken, gidebildiğimiz kadar ileri gitmek!Dialogue: 5,0:20:14.31,0:20:16.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet!Dialogue: 5,0:20:26.78,0:20:28.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paulie!Dialogue: 5,0:20:28.84,0:20:29.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin!Dialogue: 5,0:20:31.29,0:20:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz de kimsiniz?Dialogue: 5,0:20:33.29,0:20:36.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biz, Enies Lobby'nin birinci sınıf korumaları,...Dialogue: 5,0:20:36.48,0:20:40.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Kanun Gözcüsü Köpek Birimi'yiz.  Kısaca Kanun Bekçileri.Dialogue: 3,0:20:40.05,0:20:43.76,Sign2,,0,0,0,,Kanun BekçileriDialogue: 4,0:20:40.05,0:20:43.76,Sign2,,0,0,0,,Kanun BekçileriDialogue: 2,0:20:40.05,0:20:43.76,Sign2,,0,0,0,,Enies Lobby, Birinci Sınıf KorumalarDialogue: 3,0:20:40.05,0:20:43.76,Sign2,,0,0,0,,Enies Lobby, Birinci Sınıf KorumalarDialogue: 5,0:20:40.58,0:20:43.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yargıç Baskerville'in emriyle,...Dialogue: 5,0:20:43.76,0:20:47.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...hepinizi ölüm cezasına çarptıracağız!Dialogue: 5,0:20:47.93,0:20:51.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin!  Birbiri ardına gelip bizi engelliyorlar!Dialogue: 5,0:20:51.68,0:20:57.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oimo! Bu korsanların kapıdan geçmelerine izin vererek ne yaptığını sanıyorsun?!Dialogue: 5,0:20:57.99,0:20:58.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah!Dialogue: 5,0:21:01.78,0:21:03.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendimden geçmişim.Dialogue: 5,0:21:05.57,0:21:08.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eyvah! Ayağa kalktı!Dialogue: 5,0:21:11.45,0:21:16.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi affetmeyeceğim. Kesinlikle affetmeyeceğim!Dialogue: 5,0:21:23.85,0:21:25.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-Ne?Dialogue: 5,0:21:41.53,0:21:45.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-Neden... Roket Adam gökten mi geldi?!Dialogue: 5,0:21:45.82,0:21:48.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kapıları boş yere açtık!Dialogue: 5,0:21:56.71,0:21:59.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-Ne oldu?!Dialogue: 5,0:22:00.21,0:22:03.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kadar sert bir inişten sonra iyiler mi acaba?Dialogue: 5,0:22:09.31,0:22:11.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dışarı çıkmıyorlar.Dialogue: 5,0:22:27.66,0:22:29.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, ne oldu?!Dialogue: 5,0:22:33.12,0:22:35.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlar da kim?!Dialogue: 5,0:22:42.80,0:22:46.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Önce selam mı verseydik?Dialogue: 5,0:22:46.84,0:22:49.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saçmalama.  Buna ihtiyacımız mı var sanki?Dialogue: 5,0:22:49.84,0:22:51.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roronoagil!Dialogue: 5,0:22:51.76,0:22:53.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekliyorduk!Dialogue: 5,0:22:59.47,0:23:01.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aynen planladığım gibi gitti.Dialogue: 5,0:23:01.77,0:23:03.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cidden mi?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.69,0:23:09.69,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing: Galaxy 9000  Timing: Halee, PhosCity  Quality Control: Feeso, Pepperjack  Soundtracking: Halee  Graphics: Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: CrunchyrollDialogue: 5,0:07:01.47,0:07:02.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demir Parça!Dialogue: 7,0:11:14.30,0:11:17.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gomu Gomu No Makineli Tüfek!Dialogue: 7,0:11:18.19,0:11:21.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gomu Gomu No Kırbaç!Dialogue: 7,0:11:23.91,0:11:26.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dev Orak!Dialogue: 7,0:11:28.41,0:11:30.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çan!Dialogue: 7,0:11:31.52,0:11:33.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çekiç!Dialogue: 7,0:11:34.92,0:11:37.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bazuka!Dialogue: 7,0:11:42.77,0:11:45.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gomu Gomu No Damga!Dialogue: 7,0:12:24.44,0:12:29.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gomu Gomu No Volkan!Dialogue: 7,0:13:03.39,0:13:06.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gomu Gomu No...Dialogue: 7,0:13:07.10,0:13:10.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Makineli Tüfek!Dialogue: 6,0:15:13.79,0:15:15.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İp Hareketi...Dialogue: 5,0:15:16.53,0:15:18.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Topuz Düğüm!Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.71,0:00:03.37,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Koşmaya başlayalım, koşmaya başlayalım! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.59,0:00:06.46,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Bayrağımızı süsleyip, gökyüzüne kaldırarak. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.77,0:00:18.06,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Sonsuz okyanusu geçip aramaya gidelim. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:21.81,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Henüz kimse tarafından...Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:23.94,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,...bulunmamış bu dünyanın mucizesini. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:27.96,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Çarpıp duran göğsümüzdeki...Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:29.71,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,...aynı hislerle devam etmeliyiz. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:35.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Hayaller peşinde koşanlar tarafından bırakılmış ayak izleri. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:39.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Ne tür bir fırtınalı gece olursa olsun,...Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:42.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,...kalplerimizin bir olmasını sağlarsak...Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:46.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,...bu zorluğun üstesinden gelebileceğiz! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:47.86,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Her zaman ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:51.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Koşmaya başlayalım, koşmaya başlayalım! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:54.55,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Bayrağımızı dalgalandırıp gökyüzüne kaldırarak. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:57.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Kimseye göstermeyeceğiz. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.23,0:01:00.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Gözlerimizde yaşlar olsa bile. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:03.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Peşinden gidelim, peşinden gidelim! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.69,0:01:06.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Hayallerimize giden doğru yolu...Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.61,0:01:09.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,...gösteren pusulanın. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:11.40,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Durmayacağız. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:14.42,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Dünyayı dolaşarak...Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.45,0:01:15.85,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,...yeniden başlayalım! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.83,0:01:21.49,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Koşmaya başlayalım, koşmaya başlayalım! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:24.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Hedefimize doğru herkesten daha fazla. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.63,0:01:27.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Şimdi kaçmazsak,...Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.22,0:01:30.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,...yarını sıkı sıkıya kavrayabileceğiz! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:33.63,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Peşinden gidelim, peşinden gidelim! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:36.51,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Gözlerinden yansıtılmış tüm şimdiki zamanın. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:38.93,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Bembeyaz bir kalp...Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:41.43,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,...bana tüm hikayeyi anlatacak! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.73,0:01:44.43,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ Yepyeni bir dünyada...Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.53,0:01:45.83,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,...yeniden başlayalım! ♪Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HDialogue: 2,0:00:00.17,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 2,0:00:00.21,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:00:00.24,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 2,0:00:00.28,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sh